   301	    identical, or (with the cell's doubling and search records) any recorded round-1 value that disagrees with them
   302	    (_round1_problem; review rep-impl-r5). A cell refused before round 1 ("not run") or a smoke run ("not compared")
   303	    measured nothing."""
